*******************************************************************************
* TODO: Part 3 - implement alu32 (Lab 6 PDF, pp. 12-15)
* [ ] Add .subckt alu32 a[31:0] b[31:0] alufn[5:0] f[31:0].
* [ ] Instantiate as32, cmp32, bool32, and shift32 inside alu32.
*     Feed a/b to as32 and bool32; feed a and b[4:0] to shift32.
*     Chain as32's n/v/z outputs into cmp32.
* [ ] Route alufn[0] to as32, alufn[2:1] to cmp32,
*     alufn[3:0] to bool32, and alufn[1:0] to shift32.
*     Comparisons require alufn[0] = 1 so that as32 computes a - b.
* [ ] Use 32 mux4 instances to select f from the four parallel results.
*     Connect alufn[4] to s0 and alufn[5] to s1; select inputs in order:
*       d0 = fas, d1 = fbool, d2 = fshift, d3 = fcmp.
*     Thus alufn[5:4] = 00/01/10/11 selects arithmetic/Boolean/shift/compare.
*******************************************************************************

*******************************************************************************
* Lab 6 testbench (Lab 6 Submission.pdf, pp. 1-2)
* Instantiate exactly one alu32 so that the reported size is for one ALU.
* TODO: Complete shift32 and alu32 above before simulating.
*******************************************************************************
Xalu a[31:0] b[31:0] alufn[5:0] f[31:0] alu32

*******************************************************************************
* Required waveforms, copied as-is from the submission specification.
* A/B: 39 operand pairs, each held for 20ns.
* alufn: 13 operations, each held for 60ns (three operand pairs per operation).
* Both sequences cover 780ns, with 0.1ns rise/fall times.
*
* Operation order:
*   0 ADD, 1 SUB, 24 AND, 30 OR, 22 XOR, 26 A, 21 NOT A,
*   32 SHL, 33 SHR, 35 SRA, 51 EQ, 53 LT, 55 LE.
* TODO: Check the settled f result for all 39 cases and explain the plots
* and circuit size/efficiency in the group video (maximum 3 minutes).
*******************************************************************************
Wa a[31:0] nrz(0v,5.0v,20ns,0ns,.1ns,.1ns)
+ -1 0x55555555 0xAAAAAAAA 1 -2 -1 -1 0x55555555 0 -1 0x55555555 0
+ -1 0x55555555 0 -1 0x55555555 0 -1 0x55555555 0 1 -1 -1 0x55555555 0xAAAAAAAA -1
+ 0x55555555 0xAAAAAAAA -1 -1 15 0 -1 15 0 -1 15 0

Wb b[31:0] nrz(0v,5.0v,20ns,0ns,.1ns,.1ns)
+ 1 0x55555555 0xAAAAAAAA 1 0 -1 -1 0xAAAAAAAA 0 -1 0xAAAAAAAA 0
+ -1 0xAAAAAAAA 0 -1 0xAAAAAAAA 0 -1 0xAAAAAAAA 0 31 15 0 24 24 31
+ 24 24 31 1 15 -256 1 15 -256 1 15 -256

Wf alufn[5:0] nrz(0v,5.0v,60ns,0ns,.1ns,.1ns)
+ 0 1 24 30 22 26 21 32 33 35 51 53 55

.tran 780ns
.plot sd(a[31:0])
.plot sd(b[31:0])
.plot b(alufn[5:0])
.plot sd(f[31:0])
.plot x(f[31:0])
